  <h1>Flash Point Explained: Why It Matters Critically in Aerosol Formulation &amp; Safety</h1>

  <section aria-label="Table of Contents" style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;margin:18px 0 18px 0;">
    <strong>Table of Contents</strong>
